legacy_app:
	notes.py:
		NotesStore class:
			~ should include a note that was added, when listing all notes

			add_note (adds a note and returns a randomly generated 8-character lowercase ID):
				- accepts the note's text
				- adds a note and returns a randomly generated 8-character lowercase ID

			list_notes (lists all notes):
				- lists all notes
				- returns all notes

			_notes data (stores notes keyed by their ID):
				- mapping:
					- text: lookup key is the note ID
					- text: value is the note text

		NotesValidator class:
			is_valid (checks that note text contains at least one non-whitespace character):
				- accepts note text
				- checks that note text contains at least one non-whitespace character
				~ should reject empty and whitespace-only note text
				~ should accept non-empty note text
				- returns whether the text is valid
